  "system": {
    "finalName": "",
    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Knights_of_the_Old_Republic_Campaign_Guide\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Knights of the Old Republic Campaign Guide\">Star Wars Saga Edition Knights of the Old Republic Campaign Guide</a></i> </p><p>The <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Sonic\" title=\"Sonic\">Sonic</a> analogue to the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Blaster_Rifle\" title=\"Blaster Rifle\">Blaster Rifle</a>, a Sonic Rifle is a larger weapon capable of striking targets from a greater <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Range\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Range\">Range</a> than the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Heavy_Sonic_Pistol\" title=\"Heavy Sonic Pistol\">Heavy Sonic Pistol</a> while still maintaining the same damage. </p><p>Like all weapons that deal <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Sonic\" title=\"Sonic\">Sonic</a> damage, a Sonic Rifle's attacks cannot be negated using the <b><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Deflect\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Deflect\">Deflect</a></b> Talent (or any <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Talents\" title=\"Talents\">Talents</a> with <b><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Deflect\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Deflect\">Deflect</a></b> as a prerequisite). </p><p>A Sonic Rifle requires a&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Power_Pack\" title=\"Power Pack\">Power Pack</a>&nbsp;to operate. After 50 shots, the&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Power_Pack\" title=\"Power Pack\">Power Pack</a>&nbsp;must be recharged. </p>",
